          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘተሰምየ ፡ ማርቆስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በርናባስ ፡ ማርቆስ ፡ የተባለ ፡ ዮሐንስን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አስከትሎ ፡ ሊሄድ ፡ ወደደ ፡ ም ፡ ፲፪ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፪ ፡ ፳፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": "፴፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፰ ፤ ⟪ወኢፈቀደ ፡ ጳውሎስ፡ ይንሥኦ፡ ምስሌሆሙ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስ ፡ ግን ፡ አስከትሎት ፡ ሊሄድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አልወደደም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኀደጎሙ ፡ እንዘ ፡ እሙንቱ፡ በጵንፍልያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጵንፍልያ ፡ ሳሉ ፡ ተለይቷቸው ፡ ሂዶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበርና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሖረ ፡ ወኢመጽአ ፡ ምስሌሆሙ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ግብር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለመርዳት ። አንድም ፡ ለማስተማር ፡ ከእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሱ ፡ ጋራ ፡ አልመጣም ፡ ነበርና ፡ ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፫ ፡ ፲፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": "፴፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፱ ፤ ⟪ወበእንተ፡ዝ፡ተምዑ፡ወተፋለጡ፡ዘዘዚአሆሙ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለዚህ ፡ እርስ ፡ በርሳቸው ፡ ተኰራርፈ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ ተለያዩ ፡ ሐተታ ፡ አሁን ፡ በሁለቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅዱሳን ፡ ተቃኅዎ ፡ ኑሮባቸው ፡ አይደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለም ፡ ውስጡ ፡ ጥበበ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ ሁለቱ ፡ አበጋዞች ፡ ባንድነት ፡ ቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆኑ ፡ ሃይማኖት ፡ ይጸናል ፡ እንጅ ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰፋም ፡ በየራሳቸው ፡ የሆኑ ፡ እንደሆነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፲፮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፤ ⟪ወበጽሐ ፡ ሀገረ ፡ ደርቤን ፡ ወልስጥራን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስከ ፡ ደርቤን ፡ እስከ ፡ ልስጥራን ፡ ድረስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አስተማረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወረከበ ፡ አሐደ ፡ ረድአ ፡ ዘስሙ ፡ ጢሞቴዎስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በልስጥራን ፡ ጢሞቴዎስ ፡ የሚሉት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድ ፡ ምእመን ፡ አገኘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእሙሰ ፡ አይሁዳዊት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እናቱ ፡ አይሁዳዊት ፡ ነበረች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአምነት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያን ፡ ጊዜ ፡ በሱ ፡ ስብከት ፡ አመነች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአቡሁሰ ፡ አረማዊ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አባቱ ፡ ግን ፡ አረማዊ ፡ ነበር ፡ ም ፡ ፲፯ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፬ ። ፲፱ ፡ ፳፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፤ ⟪ወይንእድዎ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ቢጹ ፡ እለ ፡ በልስጥራን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደርቤን ፡ ወኢቆንዮን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በልስጥራን ፡ በደርቤን ፡ በኢቆንዮን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግን ፡ በያሉበት ፡ ያስተምራሉ ፡ ሃይማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኖት ፡ ይሰፋልና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በርናባስ ፡ ነሥኦ ፡ ለማርቆስ ፡ ወነገደ ፡ ቆጵሮስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በርናባስ ፡ ማርቆስን ፡ አስከትሎ ፡ ወደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቆጵሮስ ፡ ሄደ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": "፵",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵ ፤ ⟪ጳውሎስ ፡ ኀረዮ ፡ ለሲላስ ፡ ወሖረ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስ ፡ ግን ፡ ሲላስን፡ አስከትሎ፡ ሄደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአማኅፀንዎ ፡ ቢጹ ፡ በጸጋ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምእመናንም ፡ ጳውሎስን ፡ አደራ፡ አሉት፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ ያመንህበት ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለይህ ፡ አሉት ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፵፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፩ ፤ ⟪ወዖደ ፡ ሶርያ ፡ ወቂልቅያ ፡ ወአጽንዐ ፡ አብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያተ ፡ ክርስቲያናት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በቂልቅያ ፡ በሶርያ ፡ እየዞረ ፡ አስተማረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምእመናንን ፡ በሃይማኖት ፡ አጸና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያሉ ፡ ወገኖቹ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ያከብሩት ፡ ነበርና፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላመነም ፡ ም ፡ ፮ ፡ ፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ወአፍቀረ ፡ ጳውሎስ ፡ ይንሥኦ ፡ ምስሌሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወይሖር ፡ ወነሥኦ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስም ፡ ጢሞቴዎስን ፡ አስከትሎት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሊሄድ ፡ ወደደ ፡ ሐተታ ፡ በጎ ፡ብላቴንነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱን ፡ አይቶ ፡ ሲሻው ፡ አይቶ ፡ ኋላ ፡ ከፍ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጹምነት ፡ እንዲደርስ ፡ አውቆ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወገዘሮ ፡ በእንተ ፡ አይሁድ ፡ እለ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ውእቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚያ ፡ አገር ፡ ያሉ ፡ አይሁድን ፡ ደስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
